-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#imapwidgetmanager_mapwidgetlayer_setzindex_inline\">setZIndex</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"imapwidgetmanager_mapwidgetlayer_setzindex_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setZIndex</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setZIndex</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">zIndex</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.open.pilot.base.manager.map</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Sets the layer stacking priority. <br><br> The value ranges from 0 to 100. The larger the value, the higher the priority and the more on top the layer is. Among layers with the same priority, the later added one covers the earlier added one. An IllegalArgumentException is thrown when the value is out of range.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>zIndex</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> </code></span></td><td>Stacking priority, ranging from 0 to 100.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font